  "description": "One HTTP contract for the whole API: every success is a typed { data, meta }, every failure is an RFC 9457 problem+json, and pagination metadata rides in the same envelope — projected mechanically from OrionResult's Result<T> instead of hand-serialized per endpoint. Source-gen JSON, reflection-free and AOT-clean. Wave 1 is the types and the projection; the ASP.NET filters and OpenAPI schema land in later waves.",
